OL,3,GNEWSAJersey housing group bans balcony
OL,4,Apet enclosures
OL,5,
OL,6,FPet owners have been warned not to keep
OL,7,Fspecialist pet enclosures on their
OL,8,Fbalconies by housing association Andium
OL,9,FHomes.
OL,11,FThe group, owned by Jersey's
OL,12,Fgovernment, said it had a
OL,13,Fresponsibility to keep buildings safe
OL,14,F"for everyone who lives in them" and
OL,15,Fthe policy was being developed in
OL,16,Fconsultation with States of Jersey Fire
OL,17,Fand Rescue Service.
OL,19,FIt said it "welcomes pets" and there
OL,20,Fwere no restrictions within homes other
OL,21,Fthan those within a resident's tenancy
OL,22,Fagreement or local law.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
