OL,3,GNEWSAJersey housing group bans balcony
OL,4,Apet enclosures
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndium said pets were allowed on
OL,7,Fbalconies but the "installation of
OL,8,Fstructures" was not permitted due to
OL,9,Fthe risk of fire spread, firefighter
OL,10,Faccess and material falling from
OL,11,Fheight.
